<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Willbros raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Willbros raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised the rating on Willbros Group Inc to long-term buy from accumulate, and kept the near-term rating at accumulate.</p>
<p>-- shares were unchanged at 9-5/8.</p>
</text>
